#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:3 ebe00754022f449883a418a00c390c41
msgid "KDE (desktop environment)"
msgstr "KDE（桌面環境）"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:7 f2b86d7e17164982bc11f3287afc9888
msgid "This page is intended for advanced users."
msgstr "此頁面適用於進階使用者。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:10 8705b1a68d9545eabc8933924976a20c
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安裝"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:13 8a86c1ccfcac425f8d7b6c763f6cfdc8
msgid ""
"Prior to R3.2, KDE was the default desktop environment in Qubes. Beginning "
"with R3.2, however, :doc:`XFCE is the new default desktop environment </"
"developer/releases/3_2/release-notes>`. Nonetheless, it is still possible to "
"install KDE by issuing this command in dom0:"
msgstr ""
"在 R3.2 之前，KDE 是 Qubes 中的預設桌面環境。但從 R3.2 開始，\\ :doc:`XFCE 成"
"為新的預設桌面環境 </developer/releases/3_2/release-notes>`\\ 。儘管如此，仍"
"然可以在 dom0 中執行以下命令來安裝 KDE："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:20 143e47d16eb34626aaeaa90d745f1b8c
msgid ""
"You may notice some warnings and errors in the installation - it is safe to "
"ignore these."
msgstr "您在安裝過程中可能會看到一些警告和錯誤——忽略它們是安全的。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:22 a1da315577ca4c07974a4852a4236e76
msgid ""
"After the installation is complete log out. At the top of the log in screen "
"is a small icon with *X* on it - if you click on it you will see choices "
"between Xfce and Plasma. Select the Plasma(X11) option, and log in - you "
"will see that Plasma (the KDE desktop environment) loads."
msgstr ""
"安裝完成後請登出。在登入畫面的頂部有一個帶有 *X* 圖示的小圖標——按一下它，您將"
"看到 Xfce 和 Plasma 之間的選擇。選擇 Plasma(X11) 選項，然後登入——您將看到 "
"Plasma（KDE 桌面環境）載入。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:24 23f4d6ba921145bd8af11285e3c67084
msgid ""
"KDE is very customisable, and there is a range of widgets to use. If you "
"want to use the Menu widget, then you must edit ``/etc/X11/xinit/xinitrc."
"d/55xfce-qubes.sh`` as follows:"
msgstr ""
"KDE 非常可自訂，並且有許多小工具可供使用。如果您想使用選單小工具，則必須編輯 "
"``/etc/X11/xinit/xinitrc.d/55xfce-qubes.sh`` 如下："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:40 5fdab07dab9b47a09969fe7dbcbfe01f
msgid ""
"This allows you to edit the menu as you will. When editing the Menu *DO NOT "
"use the option under* :menuselection:`Edit --> Restore to System Menu`"
msgstr ""
"這允許您隨意編輯選單。編輯選單時*請勿使用* :menuselection:`Edit --> Restore "
"to System Menu` 下的選項。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:43 946ec5c74b6a4a299e7caf074462bc34
msgid "Login manager"
msgstr "登入管理員"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:46 158879556fb840a99263ffb03cb84c82
msgid ""
"You can also change your default login manager (lightdm) to the new KDE "
"default: sddm"
msgstr "您也可以將預設的登入管理員 (lightdm) 變更為 KDE 新的預設值：sddm"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:48 2e6e429b6fdc49afbc5164940986c134
msgid ""
"first you need to edit the ``/etc/sddm.conf`` to make sure if the custom X "
"parameter is set according to Qubes needs:"
msgstr ""
"首先您需要編輯 ``/etc/sddm.conf`` 以確保自訂 X 參數已根據 Qubes 的需求設定："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:57 44d644d92f5e4c51919ecc74acf4542b
msgid "disable the lightdm service:"
msgstr "停用 lightdm 服務："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:65 905470b253874a97af9cab0fa90fca59
msgid "enable the sddm service:"
msgstr "啟用 sddm 服務："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:73 8add995c0b30437fa8cca519994fec78
msgid "reboot"
msgstr "重新開機"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:77 0969f329485b4127b892c3c1982f1a1d
msgid ""
"If you encounter performance issues with KDE, try switching back to LightDM."
msgstr "如果您遇到 KDE 的效能問題，請嘗試切換回 LightDM。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:80 b340e1efd0194f8aa3142bc6778a26f9
msgid "Window Management"
msgstr "視窗管理"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:83 36cb6bbf70bb4f51a23b811991acbaf8
msgid "You can set each window’s position and size like this:"
msgstr "您可以像這樣設定每個視窗的位置和大小："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:98 b3f5e579fd614239bb4c40885960d2a8
msgid ""
"You can also use ``kstart`` to control virtual desktop placement like this:"
msgstr "您也可以使用 ``kstart`` 來控制虛擬桌面位置，如下所示："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:106 0da3658ad77e49c6a36ab1d721a612ce
msgid ""
"(Replace “3” with whichever virtual desktop you want the window to be on.)"
msgstr "（將「3」替換為您希望視窗所在的任何虛擬桌面。）"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:108 22df66eaf51d4da899e118f5d2fedbd7
msgid ""
"This can be useful for creating a simple shell script which will set up your "
"workspace the way you like."
msgstr ""
"這對於建立一個簡單的 shell 腳本很有用，該腳本將按照您喜歡的方式設定工作區。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:111 23607a1c0d044850a079dfd20adb50c7
msgid "Wayland session"
msgstr "Wayland 作業階段"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:113 8e955ecc26a24237bdcb9882751c7c37
msgid ""
"Default installation includes KDE Plasma X11 session. KDE project primary "
"focus is Wayland session, which in Qubes OS is currently experimental. To "
"enable the experimental Wayland session support install the following "
"package:"
msgstr ""
"預設安裝包含 KDE Plasma X11 作業階段。KDE 專案的主要重點是 Wayland 作業階段，"
"在 Qubes OS 中目前是實驗性的。若要啟用實驗性的 Wayland 作業階段支援，請安裝以"
"下套件："

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:120 56b6cd0bb1614001a4a8818229c1852b
msgid "Removal"
msgstr "移除"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:123 fafa2b437323471a9c7716006392f65b
msgid ""
"If you decide to remove KDE do **not** use ``dnf remove @kde-desktop-"
"qubes``. You will almost certainly break your system."
msgstr ""
"如果您決定移除 KDE，**請勿**使用 ``dnf remove @kde-desktop-qubes``。您幾乎肯"
"定會破壞您的系統。"

#: ../../../user/advanced-topics/kde.rst:125 749c3c9ece3c4722b47e714abc9192cd
msgid "The safest way to remove (most of) KDE is:"
msgstr "移除（大部分）KDE 最安全的方法是："
